WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.295
A note from a managing attorney in Florida.

00:00:02.920 --> 00:00:11.833
I've been disappointed with every single paralegal service — or individual paralegal, or even lawyer — I've tried to work with over the last ten years or so.

00:00:12.440 --> 00:00:16.949
You guys are different, in the best possible way, and I greatly appreciate it.
